    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPER PAPARAZZI</strong> is an over the top paparazzi photography game where you need to get a photo of the &quot;Golden Target&quot; that waits at the end of the level, but you also have to get past the &quot;Golden Target's&quot; super fans as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get past the fans, use your parkour abilities to run, jump, slide &amp; wall run around minimalist levels where you can also use your camera not only to take pictures, but also use a powerful camera flash to fight back against the super fans!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPER PAPARAZZI</strong> is an over the top paparazzi photography game where you need to get a photo of the &quot;Golden Target&quot; that waits at the end of the level, but you also have to get past the &quot;Golden Target's&quot; super fans as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get past the fans, use your parkour abilities to run, jump, slide &amp; wall run around minimalist levels where you can also use your camera not only to take pictures, but also use a powerful camera flash to fight back against the super fans!</p>",
    "short_description": "Walk, Run, Slide &amp; run on Walls to navigate levels, make sure to use your camera to take photos of Secondary Targets &amp; especially the Golden Target and make sure to pick up some batteries and use a camera flash to fight back against the Golden Target's Super Fans!",
